  "content": "<h2>自動重連（重鑄版）</h2><p>Bstn1802的<a href=\"https://github.com/Bstn1802/AutoReconnect\" rel=\"nofollow\">AutoReconnect</a>多載入器更新版本。</p><h3>關於</h3><p>若您從世界或伺服器斷線（未點擊斷線按鈕），此模組將嘗試為您重新連線。預設情況下，它會在3秒、10秒、30秒和60秒後進行4次重試。</p><p>您還可以設定在成功自動重連特定世界或伺服器時，自動發送訊息或執行指令。</p><h3>依賴項目</h3><p>Fabric需：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fP7dR8mSH\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmOgUt4GM\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f1eAoo2KR\" rel=\"nofollow\">YACL</a></p><p>NeoForge需：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f1eAoo2KR\" rel=\"nofollow\">YACL</a></p><h3>致謝</h3><p>AutoReconnect（重鑄版）基於Bstn1802的AutoReconnect，並在授權下重用了部分程式碼。</p><p>Bstn1802的AutoReconnect可在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fA9rziLV4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/Bstn1802/AutoReconnect\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>上取得。</p><h3>授權</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gnu.org%252flicenses%252flgpl-3.0.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL-3.0-only</a></p><h3>聯絡方式</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terminalmc.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&amp;label=Discord 伺服器&amp;color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/AutoReconnect/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/AutoReconnect?logo=github&amp;label=GitHub 問題回報\" alt=\"GitHub 問題回報\"></a></p>",
